      "statement": "Talon is an experimental single-event-loop local host for channels, cron, and agent lifecycle, not a multi-tenant containment boundary: its sandbox shifts shell and filesystem work but leaves MCP, web, and channel-media work on the host, and sandbox startup failure exits rather than falling back to host execution.",
